  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Engaging Border Communities in Border Security in the LiptakoGourma Region: Phase II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The global objective of the project is to sustainably support the Government to enhance border management by strengthening the relationship between rural border communities and local and border authorities to help avert cross-border crime, identify security issues and build ownership of regional challenges in Burkina Faso and Niger, and foster bilateral thematic exchanges between both communities and law enforcement forces.</narrative>
  </description>
